                                        "entry_id": "bedaf744-512c-3205-9936-38476330b232",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A perennial member of the sunflower family (Asteraceae), cultivated as a root vegetable (Pseudopodospermum hispanicum, syn. Scorzonera hispanica)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
